&lt;h3&gt;


Task 4: Code Review (Go)
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I fed each model a deliberately vulnerable Go snippet: SQL injection, unchecked error, goroutine leak. Pure security triage.&lt;/p&gt;

